                                                                   228 1451
SUMMARY                                                            228 1451
                                                                   228 1451
  This evaluation is the result of R-matrix fits performed         228 1451
by members of the INDEN Light-element collaboration meeting        228 1451
at IAEA in combined h+a and p+Li6 modelling.                       228 1451
The capture channel and Li6 excited states are not yet included.   228 1451
                                                                   228 1451
  It uses the B=-L R-matrix boundary conditions,                   228 1451
with maximum partial waves of 4 for h+a and 1 for p+Li6,           228 1451
and spin groups up to J=9/2.                                       228 1451
The channel radii are (1.4 fm) * (A1^1/3 + A2^1/3).                228 1451
The R-matrix parameters are in MF=2 in LRF=7 KRM=4 IFG=1 format    228 1451
Elastic Coulomb scattering is given with LTP=2 Legendre terms      228 1451
